and if you're really interested in a grueling session, we spent about five hours in our previous meeting going line by line by line,

00:03:57.575 --> 00:04:01.255
so that would help you understand particular line items if you're interested.

00:04:01.975 --> 00:04:07.975
It is there. I don't recommend it unless you're trying to fall asleep at night and can't find another way,

00:04:08.455 --> 00:04:17.240
but if you are interested in the details, it's certainly there and you can hear us kind of going through and asking questions on each individual line, so that is there. But this is really more of a high level presentation.

